civilizations in the Milky Way.

294
00:22:37,690 --> 00:22:39,030
Equations are equations,

295
00:22:39,030 --> 00:22:40,490
and evidence is evidence.

296
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:42,510
If there are so many
extraterrestrial civilizations,

297
00:22:42,510 --> 00:22:43,550
