303
00:22:52,550 --> 00:22:54,160
Alternatively, their life forms
may be completely different

304
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:55,350
and unidentifiable to us.

305
00:22:55,350 --> 00:22:57,880
Or maybe the Great Silence
itself is a signal.

306
00:22:58,000 --> 00:23:01,200
An unprovable conjecture
is science fiction,

307
00:23:01,240 --> 00:23:02,310
not science.

308
00:23:02,350 --> 00:23:04,720
The spirit of science lies in
exploring the unknown.

309
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:05,790
Project Ozma,

310
00:23:05,810 --> 00:23:08,000
