Sir, we...

562
00:37:05,500 --> 00:37:06,700
This is my boyfriend.

563
00:37:10,530 --> 00:37:11,730
We live together now.

564
00:37:14,050 --> 00:37:14,860
Jin Baihui.

565
00:37:16,010 --> 00:37:17,670
How can you say that?

566
00:37:23,980 --> 00:37:26,380
Is this the result
of your years of studying

567
00:37:26,440 --> 00:37:28,070
and education?

568
00:37:32,320 --> 00:37:33,920
Let's go. We'll talk at home.

569
00:37:33,920 --> 00:37:34,850
I'm not leaving.

570
00:37:35,210 --> 00:37:36,050
Hurry up and let's go.
We'll talk when we get back.

571
00:37:36,050 --> 00:37:38,310
If you have something to say, say it here.

572
00:37:42,130 --> 00:37:44,790
I don't want to scold you
in front of an outsider.

573
00:37:46,420 --> 00:37:48,020
Lin Zeqiu is not an outsider.

574
00:37:50,050 --> 00:37:51,710
You can say whatever you want.

575
00:37:56,900 --> 00:37:58,760
You think you're all grown up now?

576
00:37:59,050 --> 00:38:01,510
My words don't mean anything
to you anymore?

577
00:38:04,280 --> 00:38:04,610
Fine.

578
00:38:05,550 --> 00:38:06,880
Then let me ask you this.

579
00:38:07,710 --> 00:38:08,920
You just moved in with him

580
00:38:08,920 --> 00:38:10,320
without a proper status?

581
00:38:10,610 --> 00:38:12,070
Where is your upbringing?

582
00:38:17,110 --> 00:38:19,040
You rented this place, didn't you?

583
00:38:19,960 --> 00:38:21,690
And it's in such a remote place.

584
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:24,180
What kind of life can you give her?

585
00:38:26,670 --> 00:38:28,800
What kind of life can he give you?

586
00:38:29,260 --> 00:38:31,190
He has no house and no car.

587
00:38:32,610 --> 00:38:34,410
Is this the life you want to live?

588
00:38:36,050 --> 00:38:36,710
Sir.

589
00:38:37,440 --> 00:38:38,320
I have a job.

590
00:38:38,900 --> 00:38:40,140
I can take good care of my family.

591
00:38:40,140 --> 00:38:41,580
What can you take care of?

592
00:38:41,860 --> 00:38:44,090
She could have had a better life!

593
00:38:44,160 --> 00:38:45,180
Because of you,

594
00:38:45,210 --> 00:38:46,710
she has to suffer with you!

595
00:38:47,150 --> 00:38:48,050
Is this what you call taking care of her?

596
00:38:48,050 --> 00:38:48,860
Dad, stop it.

597
00:38:50,780 --> 00:38:52,380
I've already made up my mind.

598
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:54,800
No matter what the future holds,

599
00:38:55,280 --> 00:38:56,420
I will be with him.

600
00:38:57,010 --> 00:38:58,210
-You...
-Jin Baihui.

601
00:39:00,500 --> 00:39:02,010
Just keep being stubborn.

602
00:39:03,650 --> 00:39:04,850
The days of suffering

603
00:39:05,500 --> 00:39:06,550
are yet to come!

604
00:39:36,340 --> 00:39:37,070
Don't be sad.

605
00:39:37,800 --> 00:39:39,000
Didn't we agree

606
00:39:40,340 --> 00:39:43,270
to make your parents believe
we're really together?

607
00:39:44,130 --> 00:39:45,590
I guess it's a success now.

608
00:39:54,110 --> 00:39:54,760
I'm sorry

609
00:39:55,860 --> 00:39:57,720
that you got scolded and wronged.

610
00:39:58,630 --> 00:39:59,230
It's fine.

611
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:01,490
I'm thick-skinned.

612
00:40:01,800 --> 00:40:02,440
It's okay.

613
00:40:04,630 --> 00:40:06,560
We're just helping each other out.

614
00:40:07,730 --> 00:40:09,130
Bros help each other out.

615
00:40:12,860 --> 00:40:13,460
Thank you.

616
00:40:30,640 --> 00:40:33,710
[Huacheng City Hejia Hospital]
[Hematology Department Ward]

617
00:40:42,230 --> 00:40:44,630
You've been doing well
these past two days.

618
00:40:45,170 --> 00:40:46,970
The nurses all praised you to me.

619
00:40:55,860 --> 00:40:57,190
This is a reward for you.

620
00:40:58,210 --> 00:40:59,340
Thank you, Dr. Shen.

621
00:41:15,480 --> 00:41:17,140
Since I've been doing so well,

622
00:41:17,480 --> 00:41:18,300
Dr. Shen,

623
00:41:19,550 --> 00:41:21,210
could you take a photo with me?

624
00:41:21,400 --> 00:41:22,730
The hospital has rules.

625
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:24,810
No taking photos together.

626
00:41:25,170 --> 00:41:26,230
Just one.

627
00:41:26,880 --> 00:41:28,480
I lost a bet with my besties.

628
00:41:28,860 --> 00:41:31,460
They all took photos
with their math teachers,

629
00:41:31,550 --> 00:41:33,280
and I'm the only one who didn't.

630
00:41:41,880 --> 00:41:43,680
Absolutely no photos together.

631
00:41:47,480 --> 00:41:49,080
But you can take a photo of me.

632
00:41:50,980 --> 00:41:52,130
Just don't include
this equipment in the shot.

633
00:41:52,130 --> 00:41:52,940
That works.

634
00:41:53,590 --> 00:41:54,850
Dr. Shen, stand still.

635
00:42:06,260 --> 00:42:07,130
Smile a little.

636
00:42:09,300 --> 00:42:10,630
Strike a handsome pose.

637
00:42:11,090 --> 00:42:12,090
Make a peace sign.

638
00:42:14,840 --> 00:42:16,780
Three, two, one.

639
00:42:17,210 --> 00:42:18,110
Cheese!

640
00:42:26,820 --> 00:42:28,620
Is something on your mind today?

641
00:42:32,750 --> 00:42:34,350
But you still look handsome.

642
00:42:42,840 --> 00:42:44,640
I shouldn't have agreed to this.

643
00:42:52,550 --> 00:42:54,440
Turn off the light and go to sleep.

644
00:43:38,150 --> 00:43:39,800
This therapy is too new.

645
00:43:39,800 --> 00:43:41,330
The risk is extremely high.

646
00:43:41,610 --> 00:43:43,150
The current estimated survival rate

647
00:43:43,150 --> 00:43:45,110
is only a little over ten percent.

648
00:44:28,340 --> 00:44:30,550
To put it bluntly, this is a huge gamble.

649
00:44:37,940 --> 00:44:40,180
Shui, are you asleep?

650
00:44:41,350 --> 00:44:42,150
Wait a moment.

651
00:45:01,090 --> 00:45:01,550
Come in.

652
00:45:03,080 --> 00:45:06,600
[Huacheng City Hejia Hospital]
[Hematology Department Ward]

653
00:45:16,820 --> 00:45:17,460
Shui.

654
00:45:18,760 --> 00:45:20,890
I have to tell you something right now,

655
00:45:21,110 --> 00:45:22,570
something very important

656
00:45:22,610 --> 00:45:23,800
and serious.

657
00:45:26,340 --> 00:45:27,340
After you hear it,

658
00:45:28,460 --> 00:45:29,590
the choice is yours.

659
00:45:53,800 --> 00:45:54,730
Why are you here?

660
00:45:55,570 --> 00:45:57,030
I'm here to visit you.

661
00:45:57,900 --> 00:45:58,780
Seriously...

662
00:45:58,780 --> 00:46:00,800
I've been extremely busy lately.

663
00:46:01,670 --> 00:46:03,050
Currently, our company

664
00:46:03,050 --> 00:46:04,840
is increasingly expanding.

665
00:46:05,210 --> 00:46:07,480
I have to split myself
in two to handle it.

666
00:46:08,010 --> 00:46:09,420
Stop putting on airs.

667
00:46:09,420 --> 00:46:10,800
If your business is expanding,

668
00:46:10,800 --> 00:46:12,530
why don't you hire more people?

669
00:46:13,760 --> 00:46:15,820
This is the excellent quality
of a good boss

670
00:46:15,820 --> 00:46:18,000
who handles things personally.

671
00:46:19,190 --> 00:46:20,280
Show-off.

672
00:46:20,710 --> 00:46:22,040
Drink it while it's hot.

673
00:46:22,550 --> 00:46:23,690
I have to say,

674
00:46:25,110 --> 00:46:28,230
this coffee came right on time.

675
00:46:28,340 --> 00:46:30,130
I was really too sleepy.

676
00:46:31,860 --> 00:46:33,190
What good stuff is this?

677
00:46:33,460 --> 00:46:34,820
Your favorite.

678
00:46:38,130 --> 00:46:39,960
I can always count on you, Tang.

679
00:46:42,530 --> 00:46:43,530
Let me take a call.

680
00:46:48,670 --> 00:46:50,730
Don't dawdle. Just say it.

681
00:46:53,980 --> 00:46:54,820
Speak.

682
00:46:58,320 --> 00:46:59,860
No, how many times do I have to say it?

683
00:46:59,860 --> 00:47:01,390
Stop trying to persuade me.

684
00:47:01,760 --> 00:47:04,290
I think this issue
is not important right now.

685
00:47:04,630 --> 00:47:06,530
Everything has its priorities.

686
00:47:06,650 --> 00:47:08,530
You think your problem
is the most important now,

687
00:47:08,530 --> 00:47:09,440
but it's exactly the opposite.

688
00:47:09,440 --> 00:47:12,370
I think a technological upgrade
is the top priority.

689
00:47:14,730 --> 00:47:15,860
Unbelievable.

690
00:47:17,300 --> 00:47:18,460
What's wrong?

691
00:47:18,500 --> 00:47:19,560
Why the big temper?

692
00:47:20,590 --> 00:47:22,550
This company is full of crap.

693
00:47:22,550 --> 00:47:24,880
I don't even know
why I hired these people.

694
00:47:30,190 --> 00:47:32,030
Duan Qiyan, I don't mean to criticize you,

695
00:47:32,030 --> 00:47:33,900
but can you be a little more patient?

696
00:47:33,900 --> 00:47:36,300
You've had this bad habit since childhood.

697
00:47:36,400 --> 00:47:37,840
There's a problem
with your communication style.

698
00:47:37,840 --> 00:47:40,170
How can you negotiate anything like this?

699
00:47:40,440 --> 00:47:41,960
No, do you even know
what I'm talking about

700
00:47:41,960 --> 00:47:43,500
before you start scolding me?

701
00:47:43,500 --> 00:47:44,800
I just don't get it.

702
00:47:45,320 --> 00:47:48,030
I, Duan Qiyan,
am at least a boss to others.

703
00:47:48,420 --> 00:47:50,090
Why, in your eyes, Tang Tingting,

704
00:47:50,090 --> 00:47:51,260
am I capable

705
00:47:51,260 --> 00:47:52,460
of nothing?

706
00:47:52,500 --> 00:47:54,050
Am I that useless?

707
00:47:56,900 --> 00:47:59,230
Duan Qiyan, why are you getting mad at me?

708
00:48:00,110 --> 00:48:02,440
I shouldn't have bothered with your crap.

709
00:48:30,590 --> 00:48:31,550
This late again?

710
00:48:31,800 --> 00:48:34,200
What do you want to eat?
I'll make it for you.

711
00:48:35,360 --> 00:48:36,360
Actually,

712
00:48:37,170 --> 00:48:38,300
I'm not that hungry.

713
00:48:39,780 --> 00:48:40,510
Then...

714
00:48:40,590 --> 00:48:41,720
Just sit for a while?

715
00:49:24,160 --> 00:49:28,560
♪ I'm like the gentle clouds in the sky ♪

716
00:49:29,090 --> 00:49:30,590
I really want to try the strawberry crepes

717
00:49:29,490 --> 00:49:33,400
♪ Looking forward
to the stop of the night breeze ♪

718
00:49:30,590 --> 00:49:32,190
at that place you mentioned.

719
00:49:32,880 --> 00:49:34,210
Then let's go there now.

720
00:49:34,360 --> 00:49:35,070
Now?

721
00:49:35,020 --> 00:49:41,600
♪ I'm wandering about carefully,
looking for the answer, so at a loss ♪

722
00:49:35,710 --> 00:49:36,210
Yes.

723
00:49:36,900 --> 00:49:38,110
Sit tight and hold on.

724
00:49:38,320 --> 00:49:39,520
I'm going to speed up.

725
00:49:39,650 --> 00:49:42,000
Don't worry. The crepes won't get away.

726
00:49:42,840 --> 00:49:43,370
Let's go!

727
00:49:43,900 --> 00:49:45,000
Go!

728
00:49:45,580 --> 00:49:49,940
♪ Sometimes I wonder
if I should back down ♪

729
00:49:50,920 --> 00:49:54,980
♪ Sudden alienation between us
is what scares me the most ♪

730
00:49:56,160 --> 00:50:02,980
♪ How can two hearts beat as one
and truly feel each other? ♪

731
00:50:05,980 --> 00:50:15,720
[Strawberry crepes sold out]

732
00:50:07,210 --> 00:50:11,000
♪ The meteors fly past,
silencing thoughts ♪

733
00:50:12,980 --> 00:50:15,510
See? The strawberry crepes got away.

734
00:50:18,150 --> 00:50:19,550
We'll come back next time

735
00:50:20,210 --> 00:50:21,960
and catch them.

736
00:50:28,900 --> 00:50:30,630
It was my first time living with someone

737
00:50:30,630 --> 00:50:32,750
other than Dad, Mom, and Zeqiu.

738
00:50:34,150 --> 00:50:36,410
There was no awkwardness or discomfort,

739
00:50:37,070 --> 00:50:38,550
only a natural connection

740
00:50:39,110 --> 00:50:41,170
and happiness in every second.

741
00:50:43,010 --> 00:50:45,630
This feeling is so wonderful.

742
00:50:46,440 --> 00:50:48,300
Just like the Gaussian integral,

743
00:50:49,440 --> 00:50:53,110
the calculation process
is beautiful and magical,

744
00:50:53,920 --> 00:50:56,120
and the result is even more unexpected.

745
00:50:59,070 --> 00:51:01,470
The only person
who can give me this feeling

746
00:51:01,760 --> 00:51:03,030
is Jiang Yubai.
